    "detail": "One of the best budget hotels during my Indonesia trip. Great location, minutes away from the Tunjungan plaza. The hotel was very modern with spacious clean rooms, hot shower, great AC and wifi. The buffet breakfast was just AMAZING, so much variety and high quality food (make sure you go before 9:30 though as they can run out of some options closer to 10am). The staff were also extremely helpful and friendly, greeted us every time and even carried our big bags to our rooms while we checked-in. Can't wait to come back! ",
